2. HIGH-VOLTAGE CIRCUIT AND THERMAL MANAGEMENT\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Energy Storage:
\f1\b0  Skeleton Technologies SkelMod 500V ultracapacitor (300A High-Speed fuse).\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Inverters:
\f1\b0  2x Sevcon Gen4 Size 8. Inverter A for the main axle (KERS), Inverter B for the Sigma axle (e-Sync).\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Cooling Cycle:
\f1\b0  An electric water pump (12V PWM) circulates coolant through the hub motors and inverters. The Python code adjusts flow based on real-time temperature data.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
